    {
      "id": "dialogue.NPC_Saint_Nicholas_On_Decline",
      "source": "That’s quite alright.\nSometimes, the greatest gift\nis the one we don’t take.",
      "translation": "没关系。\n有时，最珍贵的礼物\n正是我们没有收下的那一份。",
      "context": "dialogue",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原文来源 Dialogue_EN:NPC_Saint_Nicholas_On_Decline"
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue.NPC_Christkind_Prompt_2",
      "source": "These <color=#5FCDE4>Ethereal Dice</color> are not about\nwinning or losing.\nThey are a reflection of faith—\nfaith in yourself, and in the path before you.\nDo you wish to carry them? <color=grey>(x3)</color>",
      "translation": "这些<color=#5FCDE4>虚灵骰子</color>的意义\n并不在于输赢。\n它们映照的是信念——\n对自己的信念，对前路的信念。\n你愿意带上它们吗？<color=grey>(x3)</color>",
      "context": "dialogue",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原文来源 Dialogue_EN:NPC_Christkind_Prompt_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue.NPC_Christkind_On_Decline",
      "source": "That’s alright.\nSometimes, the greatest answers\ncome not from tools, but from within.\nGo in peace.",
      "translation": "没关系。\n有时，最重要的答案\n来自内心，而非借助外物。\n愿你平安。",
      "context": "dialogue",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "原文来源 Dialogue_EN:NPC_Christkind_On_Decline"
    }
  ]
